OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on major road after
OL,4,Acar overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are long delays on the A23 in
OL,7,FWest Sussex after a car overturned,
OL,8,Ftravel monitoring site Inrix says.
OL,10,FThe website says the incident on the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway between
OL,12,FHickstead Lane in Hickstead and the
OL,13,FA272 Cowfold Road in Bolney has been
OL,14,Fongoing since about 07:25 GMT on
OL,15,FTuesday morning.
OL,17,FCongestion is backed up to Muddleswood,
OL,18,Fabout 3.5 miles (5.6km) away, Inrix
OL,19,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
